00:04:31.634 --> 00:04:34.367
[ Laughter and ews ]

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:41.467
-Goat Whiz.

00:04:41.467 --> 00:04:42.667
[ Laughter ]

00:04:42.667 --> 00:04:44.601
That's not the real name.
You're making that up.

00:04:44.601 --> 00:04:45.968
-What's that?
-You're making that up.

00:04:45.968 --> 00:04:48.133
-No, no, I'm serious.
-Really, it was Goat Whiz?!

00:04:48.133 --> 00:04:49.567
-Yeah, I'm really serious.
-Fantastic.

00:04:49.567 --> 00:04:51.901
[ Laughter ]

00:04:51.901 --> 00:04:53.200
-Finally,
a couple in New Zealand

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:55.567
unearthed a 17-pound potato

00:04:55.567 --> 00:04:57.667
that they think is
the largest ever.

00:04:57.667 --> 00:04:59.167
Here's a photo of it.
This is real.

00:04:59.167 --> 00:05:00.367
-Wow!
[ Audience oohs ]

00:05:00.367 --> 00:05:01.534
-Look at the size of that.
If you try

00:05:01.534 --> 00:05:02.767
to make mashed potatoes
out of that thing,

00:05:02.767 --> 00:05:04.000
