00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.133
[ Laughter ]
Can we take a look at it again?

00:05:07.133 --> 00:05:08.667
It looks like something
you'd see on Brown Friday.

00:05:08.667 --> 00:05:10.334
[ Laughter and applause ]
Hey, we have a great show.

00:05:10.334 --> 00:05:12.100
Give it up for The Roots,
everybody.

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:13.133
Come on, Higgins.

00:05:13.133 --> 00:05:15.267
